{"sections":[{"slug":"平展概形态射","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"平展概形态射"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">平展概形态射</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“平展概形态射”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/平坦","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">平坦概形态射</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">且</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/非分歧","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">非分歧概形态射</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的概形态射称为平展概形态射</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">概形的开浸入都是平展的</span>.</p>\n<p><span class=\"link external\"><a href=\"https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/02GH\" title=\"Stacks project [https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/02GH]\">Stacks project</a></span>: <span lang=\"zh\">域</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的概形</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的结构态射</span> $X\\to\\operatorname{Spec}(k)$ <span lang=\"zh\">平展当且仅当</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">的若干有限可分扩域的谱的无交并</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}